Responsibilities

Contribute to the development of the underwriting core system, the underwriting rule engine and the point-of-sales platform;

Collect and analyze information from an underwriting perspective to prepare user requirements.

Manage project timelines and progress, and ensure the quality and timely delivery of assigned projects;

Liaise with users, IT and vendors to design and enhance business solutions;

Perform user acceptance testing (UAT) and conduct end-user training. Support ad-hoc production issues;

Analyzing underwriting data to identify trends, reporting findings and making data-driven recommendations for improvements;

Perform underwriting risk assessments within the delegated authority limit to ensure accurate, fair, prompt and appropriate underwriting decisions. Ensure that assigned new business cases comply with the company's policy and procedures, underwriting guidelines and service pledge;

Work closely with stakeholders, e.g. legal, compliance, IT, product, business development and reinsurers, to support the development and review of new initiatives;

Others job assigned by supervisor.

參與核保核心系統、核保規則引擎和銷售點平台的開發；

從核保角度收集和分析訊息，以準備使用者需求。管理專案時程和進度，並確保所分配項目的品質和及時交付；

與使用者、IT部門和供應商聯絡，以設計和改進業務解決方案；

執行使用者驗收測試 (UAT) 並進行最終使用者培訓；支援臨時生產問題；

分析核保數據以識別趨勢，報告分析結果並提出數據驅動的改進建議；

在授權範圍內進行核保風險評估，以確保準確、公平、及時和適當的核保決策。確保分配的新業務案例符合公司的政策和程序、核保準則和服務承諾；

與利害關係人（例如法律、合規、IT、產品、業務拓展和再保險公司）密切合作，以支持新措施的開發和審查。

主管分派的其他工作。
Requirements 

Bachelor Degree Holder; Minimum 6 years solid underwriting experience in life insurance with at least 2 years in a supervisory /managerial role;

Underwriting medical authority of not less than extra mortality 50%, with high net worth experience preferable;

Good integrity, quality-oriented, good interpersonal and communications skills;

A solutions thinker, strong analytical skills and independent;

Open minded, flexible, proactive and stress positive;

Good leadership and team building skills;

Proficiency in using MS Office (Word, Excel and PowerPoint) ;

Good command of written and spoken English and Chinese, proficiency in Putonghua;

The candidate with professional qualifications (such as FLMI, ACS, ALU or equivalent qualifications) will be given priority consideration.

持有學士學位；至少6年人壽保險核保豐富經驗，其中包括至少2年主管或管理經驗；

醫學核保授權不少於額外死亡率50%，具備高淨值客戶核保經驗者優先；

誠信正直、以品質為本，具備良好人際交往及溝通技巧；

具備解決問題思維、強分析能力及獨立工作能力；

思想開放、靈活變通、主動積極且能正面面對壓力；

具備良好領導及團隊建設能力；

熟練使用Microsoft Office應用程式（Word、Excel及PowerPoint）；

良好中、英文讀寫及會話能力，普通話流利；

候選人如具備專業資格（如FLMI、ACS、ALU或同等資格）可獲優考量。
Application
Interested parties please send a detailed resume, stating current and expected salary by clicking “Quick Apply”.

Information supplied will be treated in strict confidence and used in accordance with the Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance. Applicants not invited for interview within 6 weeks may consider their applications unsuccessful.
